352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (`DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE` can replace the bridge minter at any time, raise or lower the mint cap, and unpause the token. `PAUSER_ROLE` can freeze every transfer. The `minter` address has exclusive authority to mint new supply and to burn tokens \(including `burnFrom` against any user that has granted allowance\); this address is typically the bridge contract responsible for cross-chain message handling, and its own permission model \(who can trigger its mint / burn entry points\) is therefore part of this contract's trust boundary as well. The role holders listed above and the `minter` address all have the ability to influence how the protocol operates.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
